:''For the Cat Unit, see [[Saber (Uber Rare Cat)]]. Not to be confused with [[Saber Alter (Enemy)]].''
'''Saber''' (セイバー) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Saber
|image = E 368.png
|appearance = [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
She possesses the attributes of a typical pusher, sporting very high mobility and knockback count, decent health and lighting-fast attack rate but with somewhat low attack power, but possesses the [[Omni Strike]] ability.

==Strategy==
The classic [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Erasers]] are able to meatshield against her, while you can stack up any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|ubers]] or rangers to outrange her Omni Strike and do consistent damage to her.

